            <tr><td class="band">Vendor, date, amount</td><td>The three fields IRS Pub 463 names as documentary evidence, one per row</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="band">A matching receipt</td><td>Proves the business purpose the statement alone does not (Pub 583)</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="band">Three years of records</td><td>The general retention period the IRS asks for, longer in specific cases</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="band">Business kept separate</td><td>IRS-recommended practice that keeps commingled spending out of your books</td></tr>
          </tbody>
